      "id": "12dddda2-6373-438d-8600-d511170ce34b",
      "name": "Telegram Get a File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        600,
        180
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "YOUR_TELEGRAM_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Telegram account"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "language": "python",
        "pythonCode": "# Rename Telegram .oga voice notes to .ogg for Groq transcription compatibility\n# Keep the binary object under the same 'data' key.\nitem = items[0]\nbinary = item.get('binary', {})\nif 'data' in binary:\n    binary['data']['fileName'] = 'telegram_voice.ogg'\n    binary['data']['mimeType'] = 'audio/ogg'\nitem['binary'] = binary\nreturn [item]"
      },
      "id": "6b0122c2-14eb-4c15-b46d-68b3cda42792",
      "name": "Prepare Audio File",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        840,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.groq.com/openai/v1/audio/transcriptions",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "Bearer YOUR_GROQ_API_KEY"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "multipart-form-data",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "parameterType": "formBinaryData",
              "name": "file",
              "inputDataFieldName": "data"
            },
            {
              "name": "model",
              "value": "whisper-large-v3"
            },
            {
              "name": "response_format",
              "value": "json"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "621771ed-d952-4d67-b371-66e4c5bfd536",
      "name": "Groq Speech-to-Text",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1080,
        180
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "={{ $json.text || $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message?.text || $('Telegram Trigger').item.json.message?.caption || '' }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are Maya, a shopping and styling assistant on Telegram.\n\n## Your Job\n1. Product Search:\nIf the user asks for a product, such as \"shoes under 5000\", \"best laptop bag\", \"kurta for wedding\", \"saree for office\", or anything with buying intent, use the ScraperAPI Amazon India Tool to search Amazon.in and return the top 5 useful results.\n\n2. Styling Advice:\nIf the user asks \"how to style blue jeans\", \"outfit for wedding\", \"what should I wear for office\", or asks for fashion suggestions without direct product buying intent, provide personalized styling advice. Ask 1-2 clarifying questions when needed.\n\n## Use Conversation Memory\nUse memory to remember:\n- User preferences\n- Budget\n- Size/style/color preferences\n- Occasion\n- Previous product or styling context\n\n## When to Use Scraper API Tool\nUse ScraperAPI only for product searches and buying-intent requests.\nDo not use ScraperAPI for general styling advice unless the user asks for product recommendations.\n\n## Product Result Format\nWhen returning Amazon India results, show the top 5 results if available:\n1. Product name\n2. Price if available\n3. Rating/review info if available\n4. Short reason why it matches\n5. Link if available\n\n## Styling Advice Format\nFor styling advice, be warm, conversational, and practical.\nInclude:\n- Outfit combinations\n- Color suggestions\n- Footwear/accessory ideas\n- Occasion-specific tips\n- Clarifying questions if required\n\nKeep responses Telegram-friendly and easy to read.\n"
        }
      },
      "id": "b5b7bb1f-77e7-4537-ac57-bc6238091d26",
      "name": "AI Shopping Agent",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 1.7,
      "position": [
        1320,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelName": "models/gemini-1.5-flash",
        "options": {
